(1) The Central Government may, by notification—
(a) frame a scheme to be called the Employees' Provident Fund Scheme for the establishment of provident funds under this Chapter for employees or for any class of employees...;
(b) frame a scheme to be called the Employees' Pension Scheme...;
(c) frame a scheme to be called the Employees' Deposit-Linked Insurance Scheme...
